{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52694","headline":"玄珠歌 三十 · 张果","name":"玄珠歌 三十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"逍遥着述显虚无，不出身田指道躯。\n内秘分爲上中下，寻踪尽道得玄珠。\n（按：《崇文总目》卷四着录《玄珠歌》一卷，不题撰人。\n《通志·艺文略》署通玄先生。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张果","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52694.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52694","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}